{{- /* chezmoi:modify-template */ -}}
{{- /*
Merge the Claude Code preferences from .chezmoidata/agents.yaml into
~/.claude/settings.json.

Claude Code writes its own keys here (/model, /effort, plugin installs, auto
mode). Only the keys in agents.yaml are owned by the repo. permissions and
autoMode stay machine-local: they grow per machine and can hold
work-specific text. Removing a key from agents.yaml does not remove it from
the machine.

The file is written with two-space indentation like Claude Code does, but
with sorted keys. Claude Code keeps that order on its own later edits and
appends new keys at the end.
*/ -}}
{{- $current := dict -}}
{{- if .chezmoi.stdin -}}{{- $current = .chezmoi.stdin | fromJson -}}{{- end -}}
{{ mergeOverwrite $current (deepCopy .agents.claude.settings) | toPrettyJson "  " }}
